</p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0249/3241/7583/t/18/assets/subscription-cancel-1683228163957_364x.png?v=1683228165" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0249/3241/7583/t/18/assets/subscription-cancel-1683228163957.png?v=1683228165 1536w" width="364" height="319" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-ilfuhL fjsXRa pf-249_"/><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dtMgUX gkIlDO pf-250_"><span data-pf-type="DividerIcon" class="sc-cZMNgc eFVXJN pf-251_"><i class="sc-jUosCB eNYMOK pfa pfa-circle-arrow-down"></i></span></div><p class="sc-gIDmLj eMdhGW pf-254_" tabindex="0" spellcheck="false" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Once you’ve completed your cancellation you will receive an email to confirm your subscription has been cancelled.



</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dtMgUX gkIlDO pf-256_"><span data-pf-type="DividerIcon" class="sc-cZMNgc eFVXJN pf-257_"><i class="sc-jUosCB eNYMOK pfa pfa-flag-checkered"></i></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-bqiRlB lmsiOl pf-260_"><button type="button" class="sc-iqseJM eiaQxO pf-261_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="0562e990-2f04-48ba-9b85-e726ca7ff567" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>How to skip an order</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="0562e990-2f04-48ba-9b85-e726ca7ff567" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-crHmcD engWc pf-263_"><div class="sc-fotOHu cVvtTU pf-264_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fXEqDS hwCMhq pf-265_"><h3 tabindex="0" spellcheck="false" data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-brSvTw kXcmVH pf-266_"><b>How to skip an order:</b></h3><p class="sc-gIDmLj eMdhGW pf-268_" tabindex="0" spellcheck="false" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">First log in to your Canadian Protein account, navigate to your account details and select “Manage Subscriptions”

